{"t":"Spider Egg","s":"spider-egg-53334","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Spider_Egg_249229.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Spider Egg</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Spider Egg\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spider_Egg_249229.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Living and Dead<br/>Natural Products</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 11, 2007<br/>Christmas Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20210425151416&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spider_Egg_249229.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a spider egg.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Spider\">Spider</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Tarantula\">Tarantula</a> caves, such as those found in <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Spider Eggs are very fragile and will break when attacked. They will either release nothing, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Spider\">Spider</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spider</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Tarantula\">Tarantula</a> at rare times and very rarely a <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a>. Spiders that come from those eggs will not puff like normal spiders do when taken away too far from their spawn point.<br/>To break the Spider Egg, simply use the egg. <span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Spider Egg/Breaking Statistics </i> </span><br/>In <a href=\"#/quest/against-the-spider-cult-quest\">Against the Spider Cult Quest</a> these eggs have a 100% chance of releasing a <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/against-the-spider-cult-quest\">Against the Spider Cult Quest</a></li><li>Living and Dead</li><li>The Dream Courts Quest</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["against-the-spider-cult-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"against-the-spider-cult-quest","quest":"Against the Spider Cult Quest","step":"3-2","n":10,"title":"Destruir os 4 ovos","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}